    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Verifies that with {@code limit=1}, exactly one thread passes the semaphore per period. <p>Scenario: <ol> <li>Start {@value #THREAD_COUNT} threads, each calling {@code acquire()} once.</li> <li>For each period, wait until exactly one thread has acquired the semaphore, assert the acquire count is 1, then manually advance to the next period via {@code endOfPeriod()}.</li> <li>After all periods, join all threads and verify the mock executor was used exactly as expected (timer started once).</li> </ol>"
   },
